      "id": "resolve-a-zoned-time",
      "name": "Resolve a wall time in a zone to an instant",
      "description": "A developer turns a local date and time in an IANA zone into an instant under explicit zone rules, including the DST gap and overlap (tasks meeting-in-paris, dst-gap, dst-overlap).",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "implementations/typescript/src/values.ts",
          "symbol": "ZonedIntent.resolve"
